# Check out every text file with LF line endings, whatever core.autocrlf says.
# Docker mounts and copies our shell scripts into Linux containers. With CRLF, Linux
# reads "#!/bin/sh\r", cannot find that program, and the script fails. Postgres then
# stops at deploy/postgres/init.sh and the rest of scripts/up.sh never starts.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Rubric evidence stays byte for byte as the tools wrote it. Some reports mix line endings.
docs/evidence/** -text
